,
  "README.md": 
"# demo-app

A [MiiaJS](https://miiajs.com) app.

## Scripts

| Command | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| \`npm run dev\` | Dev server with reload and type-checking |
| \`npm run test\` | Tests (\`src/**/*.test.ts\`) |
| \`npm run check\` | Type-check |
| \`npm run build\` | Build |
| \`npm run start\` | Production server |

## Configuration

Environment variables are validated by \`src/env.schema.ts\` and read through \`ConfigService\`. \`.env.example\` lists every variable, with a value where it is safe to share; secrets such as \`JWT_SECRET\` stay empty there, and the app does not start until you set them. \`.env\` holds your local values (secrets generated when the project was created) and is not committed. \`NODE_ENV\` is set by the scripts: \`development\` for \`dev\`, \`production\` for \`start\`.

## Database

The app opens the SQLite file named by \`DATABASE_URL\` in \`.env\`, by default \`data.db\` in the project folder, so there is no server to start:

\`\`\`bash
npm run dev
\`\`\`

Add a table, then create it in the database:

\`\`\`bash
npx miia g table posts
npm run db:generate
npm run db:migrate
\`\`\`

\`miia g table\` writes \`src/posts/posts.table.ts\` and adds it to \`src/db.schema.ts\`, \`db:generate\` writes SQL migrations for that schema to \`drizzle/\`, \`db:migrate\` applies them. Run both again after changing a table.

In a service next to the table, inject the typed handle from \`src/db.ts\`:

\`\`\`ts
import { Injectable, inject } from '@miiajs/core'
import { db } from '../db.js'
import { posts } from './posts.table.js'

@Injectable()
export class PostsService {
  private readonly db = inject(db)

  findAll() {
    return this.db.select().from(posts)
  }
}
\`\`\`

## Next steps

- \`npx miia g resource posts\` - a CRUD module with route schemas and a test
- \`npx miia add swagger\` - OpenAPI docs at \`/docs\`
- Docs: https://miiajs.com/docs
"
,
  "drizzle.config.ts": 
"import { defineConfig } from 'drizzle-kit'

// npm run and deno task do not load .env, and drizzle-kit needs DATABASE_URL
try {
  process.loadEnvFile()
} catch {
  // no .env: DATABASE_URL comes from the environment
}

export default defineConfig({
  dialect: 'sqlite',
  schema: './src/db.schema.ts',
  out: './drizzle',
  dbCredentials: { url: process.env.DATABASE_URL! },
})
"
